---
title: Vegetarian Chili
cooklang: 2
parent: ./Weeknight Chili
servings: 4
unit system: us customary
course: dinner
tags: [weeknight, one pot, vegetarian]
---

`Soften medium` @yellow onion{1%large}(diced), @bell pepper{1}(diced) and @carrot{1}(diced) in
@olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #dutch oven{} over medium heat for ~{8%minutes}, then
@garlic{3%cloves}(minced) for ~{1%minute}.

`Bloom` @chili powder{2%tbsp}, @ground cumin{2%tsp}, @smoked paprika{1%tsp} and
@cocoa powder{1%tsp} in the oil, stirring, ~{1%minute}.

`Simmer covered` with @crushed tomatoes{1%can|28%oz}, @kidney beans{1%can|15%oz}(drained),
@black beans{1%can|15%oz}(drained), @bulgur{1/2%cup},
@vegetable stock{1%cup}|@./Bases/Chicken Stock{1%cup}[if you are not strict] and
@kosher salt{1%tsp}. Partly covered,
~simmer{30%minutes}, until ~{the bulgur is tender}.

`Finish` with @lime juice{1%tbsp}.
